---
source: crates/odx-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_long_help().to_string()
---
Migrate addons to another Odoo series, the OCA way: history, pre-commit and odoo-lint fixes

Usage: odx migrate [OPTIONS]
       odx migrate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  addon  Migrate one addon on the branch `<to>-mig-<addon>`: its history from the source series, the repository's pre-commit fixes, then odoo-lint's upgrade fixes as the `[MIG]` commit
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -C, --project-dir <DIR>
          Run as if started in DIR

  -c, --config <FILE>
          The pyproject.toml or repos.yaml to use

      --continue
          Go on after resolving a conflict in the addon's history

      --abort
          Give up the migration in progress and delete its branch

  -j, --jobs <N>
          Override the number of parallel jobs

      --offline
          Serve forge and index data from the cache only

      --fresh
          Ignore cached data; refresh everything before answering

      --no-refresh
          Use cached data even when stale

      --refresh-index
          Rebuild the addon index for the series involved

      --json
          Machine-readable output on stdout

  -v, --verbose...
          Increase log verbosity (repeatable)

  -q, --quiet
          Errors only

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
